              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "Dear {!$Expression.First_Name_1} {!$Expression.Last_Name},<br /><br />These past few months our students have been very busy, with classes and with their Z Clubs and Z Teams as well. Hallways were full of chatter around soccer scores and chess moves, while little ballerinas practiced pirouetting.<br /><br /><strong>Zeta holds the firm belief that more opportunities today lead to more possibilities tomorrow.</strong> When a child picks up a chess piece for the first time, steps onto a soccer field, or creates something they are proud of, they also discover new strengths in themselves.<br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "618d12ac-1220-42a4-9ed6-83e330b709d4",
