              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "At Zeta, students have every opportunity to gain from such experiences. Every Zeta school offers a wide variety of Specialties, which may include chess, art, music, dance, soccer, basketball, Taekwondo, and more. Specialties are built into the school day because these moments are an important part of educating the whole child.<br />"
