                "borderColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.neutral}",
                "linkColor" : "#0054A6",
                "textColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.contrast}"
              },
              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : {
                "fontFamily" : "{!$brand.baseFontFamily}",
                "fontSize" : "{!$brand.fontSize.medium}",
                "fontWeight" : "{!$brand.fontWeight.normal}",
                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "The breadth is intentional too: children need opportunities to try different disciplines before discovering where their interests and strengths lie.  <br /><br />And they learn from people who know their craft. Specialties are taught by experts selected for their experience and deep knowledge of the subject, so students develop  real, competitive skills over time.<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reels/DYA6PfMAECu/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>Watch our students ace their Taekwondo belt tests!</u></a><br /><br />As interests deepen, students can join Z Clubs and Z Teams, with opportunities to train, perform, and compete against other Zeta schools and external teams. Specialties foster teamwork, help students understand rules and resilience, and build confidence. These are traits that hold them in good stead across other avenues of school and life.<br /><br />That is excellence with heart: giving every child more ways to discover what they love, and the tools to excel at it.<br /><br />If you would like to learn more about our Specialty programs, <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/?sftoken&#61;eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpYXQiOjE3ODk1NzU0ODQsImV4cCI6MTc4OTU3NTU0NCwiaW5kaXZpZHVhbElkIjoiaW5kaXZpZHVhbF9pZF9hYnNlbnQiLCJ0ZW5hbnRJZCI6ImEzNjAvcHJvZDIxLzZiMTEwNDZhM2VhZTQyMTM4Yjc1MzkyY2YyYTAzZmFlIiwiY29yZVRlbmFudElkIjoiY29yZS9wcm9kLzAwRGE1MDAwMDFBQTRCQkVBMSJ9.nNn0ejs6PONejnVl7eRo5ttdktXAgyQX6o0NiRuqUkg\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>sign up here for an upcoming tour</u></a>.<br /><br />We look forward to welcoming you soon!<br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br /><strong>Zeta Charter Schools</strong><br /><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:<br />✉︎  <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</a><br />&#x1f4de;<a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(646) 480-1654</a></em><br />"
